# 反例：被模拟的相，名义成分写成空白节点（L3：键必须是共享的具名个体）。
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix emmo: <https://w3id.org/emmo#> .
@prefix commagmo: <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/commagmo#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/commagmo-test#> .

ex:glassPhase a commagmo:Phase ;
    commagmo:hasNominalComposition [ a emmo:EMMO_0eabfde6_c6c5_4b1f_bf10_e4e0e06e9b2e ] .
ex:sim a commagmo:MaterialSimulation ; commagmo:hasSimulatedMaterial ex:glassPhase .
